{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今晚（13日）播出的TVB節目《愛．回家之三代同糖》單元「安教練育成記」劇情極度緊張！徐榮飾演的程祥劍所經營的健身室突爆嚴重危機，慘遭富二代惡意挖角導致員工清零，更被業主加租，面臨倒閉。程祥劍將所有希望押在關曜儁飾演的安多勳身上，究竟他能否力挽狂瀾？\n</p>\n<h2>今晚劇情大暴走 徐榮健身室慘遭清零</h2>\n<p>在今晚播出的單元中，由徐榮飾演的健身室老闆程祥劍可謂禍不單行，他因得罪了董敬文飾演的富二代Haydrian，而遭到對方毀滅性報復。Haydrian竟惡意挖走健身室所有員工，導致「員工清零」，同時業主又在此刻宣布加租，雙重打擊令健身室陷入前所未有的結業危機，讓好好先生程祥劍束手無策，場面相當揪心。</p>\n<h2>關曜儁被委以重任 出戰體能賽救亡</h2>\n<p>面對健身室隨時倒閉的困境，程祥劍（徐榮飾）決定放手一搏，將所有希望寄託在由關曜儁飾演的樂天員工安多勳身上。他要求安多勳出戰電視台舉辦的「體能 No.1」比賽，期望他能一舉奪冠，為健身室贏回聲譽和名氣，從而吸引新客戶，解決眼前的經營危機。這個突如其來的重任，讓安多勳的壓力倍增。</p>\n<h2>分身乏術陷兩難 關曜儁同時要照顧大AL</h2>\n<p>正當安多勳要為比賽加緊備戰之際，他還要分心義務照顧由張武孝（大AL）飾演、身體欠佳的堅伯，令他分身乏術。劇中安多勳性格樂天，熱心助人到「好人到離譜」的程度，頻頻講出充滿「超級正能量」的搞笑對白，加上充滿喜感的肢體動作，雖然為劇情增添不少笑料，但也讓他陷入了備戰與照顧長者的兩難局面，最終能否順利為健身室奪冠，成為今集最大懸念。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議劇情發展 期待安多勳絕地反擊</h2>\n<p>對於今晚的緊張劇情，網民已急不及待展開討論，紛紛表示期待安多勳的表現。有網民留言：「好期待關曜儁點樣救返間gym！」、「安多勳真係好人到離譜，希望佢成功！」、「個富二代好乞人憎！等睇佢有報應！」、「徐榮個角色又咁慘…希望佢可以渡過難關。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_14154383996af6dffd4d0ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_14154383996af6dffd4d0ee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4116617806af6e06f10e4b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_4116617806af6e06f10e4b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17444046076af6e076b943c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_17444046076af6e076b943c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16282551096af6e07ea9ee5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_16282551096af6e07ea9ee5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_12959515186af6e0884b405.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_12959515186af6e0884b405.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_19783549306af6e090e3d03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_19783549306af6e090e3d03.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T12:21:15.275962+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1051,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:05:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:43.442087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:43.442087+00:00","content_hash":"9d168e7b83ea949931963e37fe136bdb041de90387cc3d592a8cf5ff6d6be309","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}